OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'passionate' steam
OL,4,Arailway founder
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamily members, friends and rail
OL,7,Fenthusiasts have said they will "deeply
OL,8,Fmiss" the founder of a narrow gauge
OL,9,Fsteam railway.
OL,11,FJim Haylock, who founded Moors Valley
OL,12,FRailway at Ashley Heath, near Ringwood
OL,13,Fin Dorset, passed away on Sunday aged
OL,14,F82, following a short illness.
OL,16,FIn a website post, the beloved local
OL,17,Fattraction said that as a founding
OL,18,Fmember of Britain's Great Little
OL,19,FRailways, "Jim was also a source of
OL,20,Finspiration and encouragement to
OL,21,Fminiature railway builders and
OL,22,Fenthusiasts across the country".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
