OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'passionate' steam
OL,4,Arailway founder
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness development manager Paul Ash,
OL,7,Fwho was Haylock's friend of 35 years,
OL,8,Fsaid the railways was "his love" and
OL,9,Fthat he "never really retired" but
OL,10,Fwould continue taking visitors around.
